'=====================================================================
' Agent name : BulkReg\06 - Install Welcome Page
' Version    : 3.9.5  (BulkReg release; libraries BulkRegCommon + BulkRegAgents 3.9.5)
' Code       : ALL logic is in the script library BulkRegAgents (BR_RunInstallWelcome).
'              This agent only calls it, so it never changes between releases.
'
' HOW TO INSTALL: open the agent, click in the editor, Ctrl+A, Delete, paste this
'              WHOLE file, Ctrl+S. Designer puts each part in its place automatically.
' Designer   : Shared agent, LotusScript
'              Runtime: On event > Action menu selection, Target: None
'              (backslash in the name = Actions > BulkReg submenu; do NOT use '|')
'
' What it does (details: BulkRegAgents > BR_RunInstallWelcome):
'   Creates or replaces the Page "BulkReg Welcome" in bulkreg.nsf (start page with
'   the short procedure). Run once after installing the libraries, and again after
'   a release that changes the page. Then set Database Properties > Launch >
'   "Open designated Page" > BulkReg Welcome (guide B18a). Needs Designer access.
'=====================================================================
'#####################################################################
' --- part 1: (Options) ---
'#####################################################################
Option Public
Option Declare
Use "BulkRegAgents"
'#####################################################################
' --- part 2: Initialize ---
'#####################################################################
Sub Initialize
	Call BR_RunInstallWelcome()
End Sub
